WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.422 --> 00:00:02.895
- Hi, we'll have two
chicken nugget Happy Meals.

00:00:02.895 --> 00:00:05.206
And, do you want the guy's
toy or the girl's toy?

00:00:05.206 --> 00:00:07.923
- Um, what are the toy themes this month?

00:00:07.923 --> 00:00:12.190
(bouncy, energetic hip hop music)

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:15.603
- Oh hi, yeah can I try
this mint chocolate chip?

00:00:15.603 --> 00:00:16.727
That's really good.

00:00:16.727 --> 00:00:19.548
Actually, can I try
this nutty coconut too?

00:00:19.548 --> 00:00:20.850
Mmmmm.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:21.319
What?

00:00:21.319 --> 00:00:22.703
Oh, no.

00:00:22.703 --> 00:00:23.399
No thank you.

00:00:23.399 --> 00:00:24.700
I don't need to buy anything.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.240
- Mom, what's my social security number?

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:32.352
Should I get a HMO or a P, PP--

00:00:32.352 --> 00:00:36.215
- Will I die if I had a glass
of wine after taking NyQuil?

00:00:36.215 --> 00:00:37.690
(phone beeping)

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:38.509
(bleeping)

00:00:38.509 --> 00:00:39.536
- Scuba diver.

00:00:39.536 --> 00:00:41.324
Screw diver, that, yeah.

00:00:41.324 --> 00:00:43.182
(bouncy, energetic music)

00:00:43.182 --> 00:00:44.624
- I don't need to shower.

00:00:44.624 --> 00:00:46.344
- OK, step three, whisk.

00:00:47.196 --> 00:00:48.965
Wait, what is whisk?

00:00:48.965 --> 00:00:50.619
With the lid on top.

00:00:52.699 --> 00:00:53.447
Yeah.

00:00:53.447 --> 00:00:54.992
(fire alarm beeping)

00:00:54.992 --> 00:00:55.909
Not a fire.

00:00:55.909 --> 00:00:57.232
It's not a fire.

00:00:57.232 --> 00:00:59.771
- How long can I stay on my
parent's health insurance?

00:00:59.771 --> 00:01:00.404
(phone beeping)

00:01:00.404 --> 00:01:01.006
Oh no.

00:01:01.006 --> 00:01:02.222
That's next year.

00:01:02.222 --> 00:01:03.795
- Damn, Sarah had a baby.

00:01:04.623 --> 00:01:06.049
Ugh, but that kid does not look good.

00:01:06.049 --> 00:01:06.687
(phone beeping)

00:01:06.687 --> 00:01:08.516
- Why is everything so expensive?

00:01:08.516 --> 00:01:10.469
- [Voiceover] I don't understand anything.

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:10.893
(bleeping)

00:01:10.893 --> 00:01:11.598
- You, you stupid--

00:01:11.598 --> 00:01:12.478
(bleeping)

00:01:12.478 --> 00:01:15.598
I'm gonna kick you in your
a-a-a-a-a-asss-strology.

00:01:15.598 --> 00:01:17.083
Hey little Timmy.

00:01:17.893 --> 00:01:20.717
Yeah hi, how's your mom?

00:01:20.717 --> 00:01:22.538
But that cookies n' cream.

00:01:22.538 --> 00:01:24.307
That was a keeper.

